/target
node_modules/
**/*.rs.bk
.DS_Store

# Expo prebuild output (reproducible via `expo prebuild`)
apps/mobile/android/
apps/mobile/ios/

# Gradle build output
**/android/build/
**/android/.gradle/
**/android/.kotlin/
